  "text": "请通过当前聊天的原生工具调用读取这张虚构图片，只调用一次 ocr_image_file，准确使用以下参数：\n{\n  \"imagePath\": \"C:/Users/Administrator/Documents/Codex/2026-10-03/new-chat/work/legal-20-closure-20261018/knowledge-vision/ocr-terminal-json-ownfix-native-prepared/source.png\",\n  \"query\": \"Extract readable text exactly as visible, preserving names, numbers, dates, negation and uncertainty; mark unreadable text without guessing. Then describe only directly visible objects, layout, tables and diagrams.\\nReturn only visible text and direct observations in the image language. Do not add interpretations, keyword suggestions, current-time judgments or facts absent from the pixels, or infer application features from icons or file names.\",\n  \"model\": \"aliyun/qwen3.5-ocr\"\n}\n保持当前全局模型与视觉偏好，不修改配置、不测试其他模型、不另发OCR请求，不上传或入案。工具返回后，按图中原顺序逐行呈现实际识别的可见原文；直接可见对象可以另列。不要预先猜测图片内容、补充法律分析或输出工具内部结构。若读取失败，如实说明，本轮不重试、不切换模型。",
